- Every sheet copies `src/domains/management/cash-register/components/CashInputDrawer.tsx` **exactly**: `Drawer anchor="bottom"`, `PaperProps.sx` with `borderTopLeftRadius/RightRadius: 16`, `maxWidth: {sm:500}`, `mx: {sm:'auto'}`, grey drag pill `40×4` (`bgcolor:'grey.300'`, `borderRadius:2`, `mx:'auto'`, `mb:2`), content in `<Box sx={{p:3,pb:4}}>`. Approved sheet adds `maxHeight:'90vh', overflowY:'auto'`.
